we put  up a no-fly zone we say vladimir you  know you put any of your planes into  ukraine they're going to get shot down  and if we shoot them down do you want to  have war with us he can't even defeat  ukraine um does he want to have a war  with nato he's a guy who respects  strength and that's strength yeah that  is a strategy some rational thought from  uh an investor who is a big foe of  vladimir putin bill browder thank you  very much the book his second the first  one was a bestseller the new one is  called freezing order it goes on sale  tomorrow

